{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39582","headline":"奉使封王次宜春驿 · 翁承赞","name":"奉使封王次宜春驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微宦淹留鬓已斑，此心长忆旧林泉。\n不因列土封千乘，争得衔恩拜二天。\n云断自宜乡树出，月高犹伴客心悬。\n夜来梦到南台上，徧看江山胜往年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}